# Short blurbs shown at the top of each tab, explaining what the section does.
mainframe-tab-overwatch-description = Track your faction's personnel: monitor squads, vitals and last-known positions, and view crew through their suit sensors.
mainframe-tab-diplomacy-description = Manage relations with other factions — declare war, propose peace, alliances or trade deals, and respond to incoming proposals.
mainframe-tab-alert-description = Configure the automated threat scanner: set its detection radius, cooldown, and the alert message broadcast when hostiles are detected nearby.
mainframe-tab-economy-description = Review your faction's market activity and treasury figures at a glance.
mainframe-tab-territory-description = Watch over the territories your faction holds and run their production from home. Levels are still raised on the ground.
mainframe-tab-payment-description = Issue payroll and one-off payments to faction members from the treasury.
mainframe-tab-announcement-description = Broadcast a station-wide announcement to everyone aboard. Subject to the same access and cooldown as a standalone communications console.

mainframe-announce-placeholder = Type your announcement here...
mainframe-announce-button = Broadcast Announcement
